# Spring_Jas

A backend web application developed using Spring Boot, Hibernate, and MySQL.

## Technologies Used
- Java
- Spring Boot
- Hibernate / JPA
- MySQL
- Maven
- REST API
- GitHub

## Features
- User registration and login
- CRUD operations
- Database connectivity using MySQL
- RESTful API development

## Tools Used
- Eclipse IDE
- Postman
- GitHub
- Railway

